<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Gentyre sells Tiwheel for 98 mln rand.</title>
<headline>Gentyre sells Tiwheel for 98 mln rand.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gentyre Industries Ltd said on Thursday it had sold its entire stake in Tiger Wheels Holdings Ltd for 98.3 million rand resulting in a profit of 92.8 million rand.</p>
<p>It said the full financial effects of the sale will be published together with the interim results during February.</p>
<p>Shareholders were urged to exercise caution in their share dealings until the announcement of the financial effects was made.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
